{"name": "Echoes of Eta", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/b3cbac656a94c272da87453435aee82e.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/b3cbac656a94c272da87453435aee82e.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/b3cbac656a94c272da87453435aee82e.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to\u00a0Nereid-42</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/0d1c0a94df43003f5c594621f3aa4db2.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/0d1c0a94df43003f5c594621f3aa4db2.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/0d1c0a94df43003f5c594621f3aa4db2.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Viktor Revik, who wakes up after the planetary apocalypse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the deep-sea survival journey set on the mysterious alien ocean planet Nereid-42. Discover what happened to existing human colonies after the Crimson Cataclysm, and the secrets that are hidden under the deep sea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Underwater Survival Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/a90e519a43c7ff0d5ac0f1fbcdb61dce.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/a90e519a43c7ff0d5ac0f1fbcdb61dce.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/a90e519a43c7ff0d5ac0f1fbcdb61dce.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance your survival needs for oxygen, hunger, and thirst in an extreme alien environment. Explore diverse locations to scavenge resources and uncover potential technologies that can enhance your survival capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Ship, Your Mobile Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship comes equipped with automation systems and extensive customisation options. However, the harsh underwater environment of Nereid-42 will constantly challenge your ability to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/027ab115f7ef02c7fcff3521465d7065.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/027ab115f7ef02c7fcff3521465d7065.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/027ab115f7ef02c7fcff3521465d7065.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use available space to construct modular structures that support your long-term survival. Manage production resources and monitor your ship's power supply before venturing into the deep sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft Advanced Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/72042c94588b65b681a2a2b22790bc12.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/72042c94588b65b681a2a2b22790bc12.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/72042c94588b65b681a2a2b22790bc12.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create survival equipment and deployable modules to upgrade your character. From repair tools to automated defence turrets, every tool can become essential for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Progress technology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/cbf638cbce0bb8e7d919560fa675e058.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/cbf638cbce0bb8e7d919560fa675e058.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/cbf638cbce0bb8e7d919560fa675e058.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance through Eta's self-evolving technology system. Analyse unknown entities and collect data from the remnants of humanity's lost civilisation. Progress the tech tree and unlock new craftable structures and equipment blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat Hostile Threats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/2692fa31bf43782483b8235fa1f19477.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/2692fa31bf43782483b8235fa1f19477.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/2692fa31bf43782483b8235fa1f19477.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">P.U.L.S.E. provides comprehensive solutions for defence and offence by analysing local extreme threats and recovered human weapon technologies. Construct advanced biomechanical robots to accompany you on your journey, protect mining operations, and fight against hostile predators lurking in the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Rare Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/6aa893c51879cb34ebc730e589587656.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/6aa893c51879cb34ebc730e589587656.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/6aa893c51879cb34ebc730e589587656.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use moonpool robotic arms and automated mechanical units to recover valuable materials, or explore the ocean depths yourself in a specialised diving suit to discover rare resources hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Biomechanical Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research and replicate the unique characteristics of local species to create advanced biomechanical companions. They can assist you with transportation, provide powerful combat capabilities, or extract valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"368\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/dd60454c4c3e8aa204c9cc37d2e519de.poster.avif?t=1787823651\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/dd60454c4c3e8aa204c9cc37d2e519de.webm?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/extras/dd60454c4c3e8aa204c9cc37d2e519de.mp4?t=1787823651\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and customise your companions through equipment and module slot systems, enhancing their abilities as you explore the unknown world together.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Echoes of Eta is an underwater PVE survival game with RPG elements. Scavenge natural resources to customise your mobile base ship, build portable tools and robotic companions. Explore the abyss and uncover the truth behind humanity's collapse.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781490/afaeccaaf637ab86ce98d52aa0ed58b4a9315a60/header.jpg?t=1787823651", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Survival", "RPG", "PvE", "Crafting", "Underwater"], "developers": "Cheshirecrow, GrayNekoBean", "publishers": "Cheshirecrow, GrayNekoBean", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4781490", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/cbQ86r9KXNw", "first_seen": 1787781600.0, "review_rank": 18}